  "question": {
    "text": "<p>For a perfect gas, two pressures <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> are shown in figure. The graph shows</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/81730a84-d2b5-488f-8df0-7095da14b460-image.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 195px;\" /></p>",
